Package: PhenotypeTemplates
Type: Package
Title: Phenotype Templates for PhenVal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jamie", "Gilbert", email = "gilbert@ohdsi.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates a combinatorial set of OHDSI cohort definitions from a 
    parameterized phenotype configuration. Supports multiple evidence-strictness 
    levels, hospitalization requirements, index specificity modes, and A-exclusion 
    variants across configurable clinical courses and care settings.
